NOTICE:

This application is designed to support harm reduction practices for individuals
managing substance use. It is provided as a tool for personal health tracking
and should not replace professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.

The developers and contributors of this software:
- Do not condone illegal drug use
- Support evidence-based harm reduction approaches
- Respect user privacy and data security
- Are committed to non-judgmental, pragmatic solutions

For professional help with substance use concerns, please contact:
- Your healthcare provider
- Local addiction services (CSAPA, CAARUD in France)
- National helplines (Drogues Info Service: 0 800 23 13 13 in France)

If you or someone you know is in crisis:
- Emergency services: 15 (SAMU) or 112 (European emergency number)
- Suicide prevention: Contact local crisis helplines

This software comes with no warranty and the authors are not liable for any
outcomes resulting from its use.
